        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I've quickly checked an in pure Python mode this works fine:\n\n```\nimport cython\n\n@cython.cclass\nclass C:\n    __slots__ = (\"a\", \"b\")\n    a: object\n    b: list\n```\n\n(i.e. `__slots__` don't get in the way, even if Cython doesn't use the information.) I think that's fine and probably what we want so I'll close the issue.",
            "created_at": "2026-11-16T07:55:11Z",
